Rendering the Great Outdoors: Fast Occlusion Culling for Outdoor Environments,"URL: http://www.newsisfree.com/click/-0,8613679,159/ Date: 2002-10-06T18:12:41+01:00 Rendering engines used in today�s game titles utilize various techniques for hidden surface removal (HSR), different techniques being suitable for different game genres. For example, action games played in closed-in locations need an engine allowing fast rendering of a few hundred polygons, a high frame rate, and a high level of details to impress players. Conversely, a game that is taking place outdoors requires quite a different approach. This features present one one technique for hidden surface removal usable in 3D engines using tilizing object occlusion.","Rendering the Great Outdoors: Fast Occlusion Culling for Outdoor Environments URL: http://www.newsisfree.com/click/-0,8613679,159/ Date: 2002-10-06T18:12:41+01:00 Rendering engines used in today�s game titles utilize various techniques for hidden surface removal (HSR), different techniques being suitable for different game genres. For example, action games played in closed-in locations need an engine allowing fast rendering of a few hundred polygons, a high frame rate, and a high level of details to impress players. Conversely, a game that is taking place outdoors requires quite a different approach. This features present one one technique for hidden surface removal usable in 3D engines using tilizing object occlusion.",0,20030228_easy_ham.tar.bz2,easy_ham/02339.6a217c7473a881cc0d68a2c1617722e4,f7e455cebc568dd30390cd1b305691d7a47b0024db125bd8df986a96faf61d79
