ording your mana flux, too. (Conclusive evaluation by entrail reading is nonoptional only for confirmed terrorists). So they claim terrorist intent translates in biosignatures they can pick up by close-distance passive telemetry, in realtime, with a very low number of false positives, while having no chance to calibrate, in the field. Right. Seems somebody is so awfully eager to pick up a slice of research grant pie from the heimatland securitate money they haven't even bothered to invent a plausible lie. http://xent.com/mailman/listinfo/fork",0,20030228_easy_ham_2.tar.bz2,easy_ham_2/01052.7a69c765a964be2a05e33723b7ab926f,75bcd685da0adc78c692a3a7c8a8d53069715ae2a968fe7954a3db22cc3212f0
