[ILUG] Serial port trouble,"Hi, Can anyone offer me any advice on using an MRi dual port PCI - serial card. MRi claim it works, but that not at 9600 baud. I AM using it at 9600, but I get a 10s delay on output, followed by just 16 bytes, repeated untill complete. Similarly, on input, I get a delay before the app' sees the data. TIA Shane -- Irish Linux Users' Group: ilug@linux.ie http://www.linux.ie/mailman/listinfo/ilug for (un)subscription information. List maintainer: listmaster@linux.ie","[ILUG] Serial port trouble Hi, Can anyone offer me any advice on using an MRi dual port PCI - serial card. MRi claim it works, but that not at 9600 baud. I AM using it at 9600, but I get a 10s delay on output, followed by just 16 bytes, repeated untill complete. Similarly, on input, I get a delay before the app' sees the data. TIA Shane -- Irish Linux Users' Group: ilug@linux.ie http://www.linux.ie/mailman/listinfo/ilug for (un)subscription information. List maintainer: listmaster@linux.ie",0,20030228_easy_ham_2.tar.bz2,easy_ham_2/00413.b7905c2033fef30a91bf1dcc4f0343bb,4550aa3e72ec6a82e8de83777370b2177a7daf25f5b5dfe7bdfbd2c9cae20e77
