rown to become the answer because the government, over a >>span of years, and with the help of the Courts -has- limited the >>rights we have as citizens under the First Amendment. >> >> > >Wishful thinking. People are just bigger dickheads now. Culture is changing >and it is becoming acceptable to get in peoples face and shout them down >when you disagree with them. The people that do this are NOT >disenfranchised. They >get their rocks off on being disagreeable assholes. The act of protesting is >more important than the actual issue being protested for most of these >people. > > In my experience, this is classic ""American"" behaviour, and I don't think its on the increase outside of the US of A. I am willing to accept the premise that Americans are bigger dickheads then they used to be. Owen",0,20030228_easy_ham.tar.bz2,easy_ham/00819.cbb61ae5d168944f5a02eccfd7217173,67789250ed8597c75c092755525440f9476a7d273da2fd52c7030ecfbbd1f9ec
