Another low probability event,"So, a new family moved in down the street, with two kids, making us very excited that there might be a child around the same age (20 months) as our daughter Tatum. While we're talking to the family, we discover that their daughter Kiara was born the same day as Tatum, within two hours, in the same exact maternity ward. Both mothers were undoubtedly in labor at the same time. Wow. - Jim","Another low probability event So, a new family moved in down the street, with two kids, making us very excited that there might be a child around the same age (20 months) as our daughter Tatum. While we're talking to the family, we discover that their daughter Kiara was born the same day as Tatum, within two hours, in the same exact maternity ward. Both mothers were undoubtedly in labor at the same time. Wow. - Jim",0,20030228_easy_ham.tar.bz2,easy_ham/00356.f414aefc1fc74d9cd77da0f07f64546c,9adfe8d3c7e1d59f95e54521949f890c55cef1ae9273229ec8ed22f4c23b9de2
