siness with you and do solicit your confidentiality in this transaction, Please mail your response to me. Yours faithfully, Anderson K. Eseimoku -- Irish Linux Users' Group: ilug@linux.ie http://www.linux.ie/mailman/listinfo/ilug for (un)subscription information. List maintainer: listmaster@linux.ie",1,20030228_spam.tar.bz2,spam/00270.5dcd9ce3be2992222b9038d7bf75a23a,80d7b0043c31ecdf85eab67fb6dcd1110daf8e44c5ed367fbf0369f0b585981a
